# Lab Architecture Overview

# Purpose
The goal of this lab is to build a secure and controlled cybersecurity environment for learning and experimentation.

# Design Principles
- Security first
- Network isolation
- Minimal attack surface
- Progressive complexity

# Components
- VPN Gateway: Raspberry Pi (OpenVPN / WireGuard)
- Workstation: Debian 12 (Dell laptop)
- Virtual Machines: Isolated lab environments

# Network Flow (High-Level)
All access to the lab is performed through a secure VPN gateway.
